  <p>PrintProfit is a small independent project with one goal: help people who sell 3D prints understand whether they're actually making money. We build free tools and write honest guides — no hype, no guaranteed-income promises, and no fake reviews.</p>

  <h2>What we make</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A <a href="https://printprofit.pages.dev/">free pricing calculator</a> that includes the costs most sellers forget.</li>
